# B"H
# Boruch Hashem
# Blessed is He
#
# The Awtsmoos renews each boundary without carrying yesterday's shadows.
# Awtsmoos.com keeps source and explicitly named runtime assets in Git while
# plans, proofs, logs, caches, archives, and machine state remain outside.

